Mplus VERSION 9 DEMO (Mac)
MUTHEN & MUTHEN
09/17/2026  10:58 PM

INPUT INSTRUCTIONS

  TITLE: One indicator two-profile LPA with scalar group random intercept;
  DATA: FILE = mixture.dat;
  VARIABLE: NAMES = y1 group;
    USEVARIABLES = y1;
    CLUSTER = group;
    CLASSES = cb(1) cw(2);
    BETWEEN = cb;
  ANALYSIS: TYPE = TWOLEVEL MIXTURE;
    ESTIMATOR = ML;
    ALGORITHM = INTEGRATION;
    INTEGRATION = 101;
    STARTS = 50 10;
    MITERATIONS = 10000;
    LOGCRITERION = 0.000000001;
    RLOGCRITERION = 0.000000001;
    MCONVERGENCE = 0.000001;
  MODEL:
    %WITHIN%
    %OVERALL%
    y1;
    %BETWEEN%
    %OVERALL%
    y1;
  MODEL cw:
    %WITHIN%
    %cw#1%
    [y1];
    y1;
    %cw#2%
    [y1];
    y1;
  OUTPUT: TECH1;
  SAVEDATA: RESULTS = mixture-results.dat;

*** ERROR
  The following MODEL statements are ignored:
  * Statements in Class %CW#1% of MODEL CW on the WITHIN level:
    [ Y1 ]
    Y1
  * Statements in Class %CW#2% of MODEL CW on the WITHIN level:
    [ Y1 ]
    Y1
*** ERROR
  One or more MODEL statements were ignored.  These statements may be incorrect.

